<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CHEMAPOL SAYS SIGNS $60 MLN LOAN.</title>
<headline>CZECH CHEMAPOL SAYS SIGNS $60 MLN LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Chemapol Group a.s. said on Monday it had signed for a $60 million credit with Credit Lyonnais at a rate of LIBOR +0.625 percent.</p>
</text>
